  "description": "Despite his good looks, Seungdo has built a wall around himself. No matter who tries to get close to him - nor how hard they try - no one has ever succeeded. Yet, when Horang appears in his life, determined to shatter those barriers, a captivating tale of determination and devotion unfolds. Will Horang's unwavering resolve be the key to unlocking Seungdo's heart? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
